<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-115] LocalBookKeeper fails after BOOKKEEPER-108</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-115</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After adding configuration to Bookkeeper, localbookie doesn&apos;t start because it fails to find /tmp/bk-txn.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The problem is that the configuration uses addProperty where it should use setProperty.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
